  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;CHITOSE AIR BASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chitose Air Base is a base in Hokkaido, Japan, where the squadrons were initially formed and operated from."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORTUGUESE AIR FORCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Portuguese Air Force is an organization that operates C-130H Hercules aircraft and has had various commanders since 1977."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;C-130H HERCULES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"C-130H Hercules is a type of aircraft operated by the Portuguese Air Force, participating in events such as the Air Mobility Rodeo."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MCCHORD AFB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"McChord AFB is a location where the Portuguese Air Force C-130H Hercules participated in the Air Mobility Rodeo of 1994."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AIR MOBILITY RODEO OF 1994&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Air Mobility Rodeo of 1994 is an event where the Portuguese Air Force C-130H Hercules participated."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LT. COLONEL PILAV MANUEL ALVARENGA DE SOUSA SANTOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lt. Colonel PILAV Manuel Alvarenga de Sousa Santos was the commander of the Portuguese Air Force from September 1977 to January 1978."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LT. COLONEL PILAV JOÃO CARLOS DE AGUIAR E SILVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lt. Colonel PILAV João Carlos de Aguiar e Silva was the commander of the Portuguese Air Force from January 1978 to August 1979."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LT. COLONEL PILAV JOSÉ FERNANDES NICO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lt. Colonel PILAV José Fernandes Nico was the commander of the Portuguese Air Force from August 1979 to November 1981."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;C-130H-30 HERCULES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"C-130H-30 Hercules is a specific model of the C-130H Hercules aircraft operated by the Portuguese Air Force."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEPTEMBER 1977&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"September 1977 marks the start of Lt. Colonel PILAV Manuel Alvarenga de Sousa Santos' term as commander of the Portuguese Air Force."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JANUARY 1978&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"January 1978 marks the end of Lt. Colonel PILAV Manuel Alvarenga de Sousa Santos' term and the start of Lt. Colonel PILAV João Carlos de Aguiar e Silva's term."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUGUST 1979&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"August 1979 marks the end of Lt. Colonel PILAV João Carlos de Aguiar e Silva's term and the start of Lt. Colonel PILAV José Fernandes Nico's term."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NOVEMBER 1981&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"November 1981 marks the end of Lt. Colonel PILAV José Fernandes Nico's term."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;T-37C&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"T-37C is mentioned as a legacy aircraft, though it is not directly related to the C-130H Hercules or the Air Mobility Rodeo."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAIS ALTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PUBLICATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mais Alto is a publication where an article about the T-37C was published."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIBLIOGRAPHY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
