    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADELINO CARDOSO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Adelino Cardoso is the author of an article in Mais Alto about the T-37C."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;T-37C - UM LEGADO DA MEMÓRIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ARTICLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"T-37C - Um legado da memória is the title of the article by Adelino Cardoso in Mais Alto about the T-37C."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HISTORIAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Historial is a historical document about the Portuguese Air Force, archived online."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORTUGUESE AIR FORCE SAYS GOODBYE TO ALPHA JET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Portuguese Air Force says goodbye to Alpha Jet is an event mentioned in the bibliography, though it is not directly related to the C-130H Hercules or the Air Mobility Rodeo."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0406-cdf455419782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAIS ALTO 401&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
